(text "BANK2 / DS3 + DS4" (at 12.7 101.6 0) (effects (font (size 2.3 2.3)) (justify left)) (uuid "74cd24f7-f61b-58b6-82cc-76599dd43b14"))
(text "BANK3 / DS5 + DS6" (at 12.7 162.56 0) (effects (font (size 2.3 2.3)) (justify left)) (uuid "87917e9e-ed53-534e-9102-8fe7e35ad113"))
(text "BANK4 / DS7 and gate sinks / USB INPUT SOFT START" (at 12.7 223.52 0) (effects (font (size 2.3 2.3)) (justify left)) (uuid "9064b89b-5e4d-53bf-9059-cbdf8945261f"))
(text "COLUMN1..3 / gate pullups and anode discharge" (at 12.7 284.48 0) (effects (font (size 2.3 2.3)) (justify left)) (uuid "5293d644-dcef-50ce-b59f-a77e417f2ae6"))
(text "COLUMN4..5 / gate pullups and anode discharge" (at 12.7 345.44 0) (effects (font (size 2.3 2.3)) (justify left)) (uuid "1e684c4e-14c6-517b-80e9-035c0b7bdecf"))
(text "RAIL SWITCHES / common EN / quick discharge" (at 12.7 406.4 0) (effects (font (size 2.3 2.3)) (justify left)) (uuid "1aa8ef94-ed70-5e93-ba19-d1ea77fe4a85"))
(text "USB / CC current sensing and ESD" (at 12.7 467.36 0) (effects (font (size 2.3 2.3)) (justify left)) (uuid "4293d161-b463-5666-85cf-66e916ed6364"))
(text "BC1.2 / automatic USB switch / GOOD_BAT uses always3V3" (at 12.7 528.32 0) (effects (font (size 2.3 2.3)) (justify left)) (uuid "ba2ed984-ef00-59ab-9c5e-b591ec580241"))
(text "MCU WIRES J1..J10 / external XIAO RP2040 Plus" (at 12.7 589.28 0) (effects (font (size 2.3 2.3)) (justify left)) (uuid "c4080c5f-b517-5a24-8c8c-0523430efd1b"))
(text "MCU DATA / BC STATUS + USB BREAKOUT WIRES / do not power both USB sockets" (at 12.7 650.24 0) (effects (font (size 2.3 2.3)) (justify left)) (uuid "35f1e45e-8851-5ce4-8da8-36de92ff0ea2"))
(text "Named labels connect matching nodes. Every package pin is explicit; crosses mark intentional no-connects. Owner-supplied LEDs and wire pads are excluded from factory assembly." (at 12.7 754.38 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "70051b0e-be09-5990-9c92-2a3bf7a78143"))
(text "IREF=6.8k: 7.42493mA nominal per LED. U4 OUT7..11 sink PMOS gates, exactly one selected column. BLANK HIGH disables every LED and gate sink." (at 12.7 759.46 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "a1bcedce-ce9c-5d01-a664-5be45241a4f0"))
(text "400Hz frame / 5x500us phases / >=30us BLANK before next phase / <=470us full on. LAT LOW while shifting, pulse HIGH then LOW while blanked." (at 12.7 764.54 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "96af4c19-3e64-532b-97f0-c80804a0e2e9"))
(text "USB-C 5V only, no PD. Adafruit4090 supplies separate5.1k Rd resistors; no duplicate Rd on this board. CC divider loading checked against tolerance." (at 12.7 769.62 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "1b3e5c73-61ef-5f54-b6e3-ce70856ea058"))
(text "Both TPS22918 switches default OFF. BLANK pullup uses SW_3V3. Park serial controls LOW and BLANK high-Z before disabling rails to prevent backfeed." (at 12.7 774.7 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "192d64dd-00fd-5d44-92fa-51904cfd1143"))
(text "TPD4E05U06 opposite NC pads are joined by external copper to corresponding DC nets. Do not treat the IC as internally flow-through." (at 12.7 779.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "fc07da17-3398-5ecb-b3eb-5ea7ad28b958"))
(text "BQ24392 isolates raw USB_DP/DM from USB_DP_HOST/DM_HOST. GOOD_BAT always3V3; BC full grant requires DET HIGH and AL_N LOW; host suspend always overrides." (at 12.7 784.86 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "08f7a6a1-342b-5e75-8e10-b33c86ff87fe"))
(text "One owned LED fully diode-verified; check other20. Fit/current/inrush/suspend, 30us deadtime and temperature need bench tests. In2: CT_5V<=12mm only; In4: pure GND." (at 12.7 789.94 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "beec0473-3c07-5cfc-ba1b-386d1a283717"))
